# 27. Licensing

Recommended application license:

**MIT**

However:

The application code license and AI model license are separate concerns.

Before distributing a model:

- verify its license
- keep attribution if required
- check commercial-use restrictions
- check redistribution requirements
- document the model source

Do not assume every "open-source AI model" has an MIT license.

