# 37. Product Positioning

The product should NOT be marketed as:

> "Another AI background remover."

Instead:

> **PixelForge is an open-source image toolkit designed to give students and creators essential image-processing tools without forcing them into subscriptions or paid APIs.**

Core differentiators:

1. Free
2. Open source
3. No account required
4. Privacy-first
5. Browser-based
6. Student-friendly
7. Responsive
8. No watermark
9. Multiple image tools in one place
10. Community-driven

---

