# 39. Final Product Principle

The project should prioritize:

```text
USEFULNESS
   ↓
SIMPLICITY
   ↓
PRIVACY
   ↓
PERFORMANCE
   ↓
OPEN SOURCE
   ↓
ADVANCED AI
```

Do not sacrifice the first five merely to add more AI features.

The strongest version of PixelForge is not the one with the most buttons.

It is the one where a user can upload a photo, remove its background, make it look better, resize it, and download the result in seconds — without creating an account or paying for credits.
